# Data & Storage

## poems.ts

```typescript
export interface Poem { id: string; title: string; poet: string; verses: Verse[] }
export const poems: Poem[] = poemsData; // from public/data/poems.json
export const getPoem = (id: string) => poems.find(p => p.id === id);
export const getAdjacentPoems = (id: string) => ({ prev, next });
```

- ID format: `"poem_1519.html"` (از aldiwan)
- Verse: `first`, `second`, `translations[{ lang, text }]`

## IndexedDB (`lib/db.ts`)

- DB name: `IbnAlfardDB`, version: **5**
- Stores: `poems`, `bookmarks` (key: poemId), `settings` (key: key)
- API: `getDB`, `savePoems`, `searchPoems`, `toggleBookmark`, `isBookmarked`, `getBookmarkedPoems`, `getSetting`, `setSetting`

### تغییر schema

Version را bump کن + migration در `upgrade()`. Breaking change بدون migration ممنوع.

## settings.ts

```typescript
interface SettingsState { fontSize: string; theme: "light" | "dark" | "system" }
```

Key در DB: `"app-settings"`. از `getStoredSettings` / `saveStoredSettings` استفاده کن.

## poems.json

فرمت JSON بالا را رعایت کن. فایل در `public/data/` — rebuild لازم بعد از تغییر.
